{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act16side_level_act16side_05_end",
  "groupId": "act16side",
  "stageId": "act16side_05",
  "title": "葬禮",
  "storyCode": "GA-5",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act16side/level_act16side_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c9f48bfa8273d51fccdc248c70668522c19b522f2c87357b99f8895b137c05e2",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "26_g5_laterano_chapelout"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4036_forcer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞茜莉亞，小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾澤爾哥哥！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕蒂亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_357_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先導......我們不能退讓了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4036_forcer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你！別想把塞茜莉亞當成籌碼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......艾澤爾！帶塞茜莉亞過來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4036_forcer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，艾澤爾！你到底怎麼回事！難道你真和這幫......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕蒂亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_357_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "異端分子還是恐怖組織？教廷也只能想出這種無聊的罪名了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "帕蒂亞，滾開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕蒂亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_357_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "菲亞梅塔......你說得對，沒有誰的想法能夠輕易改變。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕蒂亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_357_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你我都一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你似乎過得不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "托你的福。你倒是老了不少......“隊長”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也是托你的福。那處銃傷很久才好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈，不錯。總好過挨她的子彈吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蕾繆安差點就死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總好過挨她的子彈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......看來你的瘋病並沒好多少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，那邊的小子，你就是那個艾澤爾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4036_forcer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（又一個萬國信使嗎......現在究竟應該......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4036_forcer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......墮天使？！菲亞梅塔小姐，這是怎麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......啊，是啊，墮天。理所當然，你用銃對我射擊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你感受不到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，現在，我會用眼睛觀察，用心判斷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那邊的小姑娘，是叫塞茜莉亞對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐，你有角，也有光環......你是薩科塔嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，可能算是？不過我也不太確定呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽著，艾澤爾，帶塞茜莉亞過來。她不會有事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4036_forcer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......一個墮天使的承諾......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總比那個凶巴巴的黎博利更可信吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂！你說的是對面那個對吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕蒂亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_357_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......莫斯提馬，她母親的葬禮還沒有結束。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇，我差點信了，安多恩，你是這麼盡職盡責的安魂教堂主祭嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "莫斯提馬！你跟我來是為了和他敘舊的嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾澤爾，想好了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4036_forcer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞茜莉亞，我們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅塞菈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_363_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞茜莉亞......你還有沒做完的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4036_forcer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安多恩，你這兒人可真夠多的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼大陣仗，就為了接一個塞茜莉亞？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，還有句話要帶給你。鎖與匙裡的那傢伙讓我告訴你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "勇氣可嘉，但你不會喜歡最終答案的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感謝建言。雖然沒有機會與它同行，但當年它為我掀開紗幔一角，已使我受益良多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......看看你現在的樣子，你確定是“受益”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唯人自知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——不對，艾澤爾，後退！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你能相信嗎——\n我看到了一片信仰凝結而成的海洋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "26_g4_laterano_cathedralliving"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......以上，就是本次的行動報告。在座部分同僚此前已參與到事件中，報告如有遺漏，煩請補充。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "同僚們，我提請全城立刻進入戒嚴狀態。安多恩就夠麻煩的了，現在還加上了“混血薩科塔”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_361_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "銃騎吉奧瓦尼閣下，會議很快就要開幕，現在全城戒嚴，你知道會在外國使節中引起怎樣的恐慌嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "樞機，對於這樣的危險分子，若是僅僅“引起一些恐慌”就能解決問題，那就是最好的結果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_361_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "教宗閣下籌備多年的會議......未來的“萬國峰會”，它可能成為拉特蘭立足於大地的基點之一。但現在，一場恐慌就足以毀了它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你如何知道，放任安多恩，他就不會毀了這場會議？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "銃騎吉奧瓦尼閣下，您太緊張了，不過是一群不成氣候的喪家之徒和一個來路不明的女孩......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奧倫，你以為拉特蘭城為什麼能夠維持千年和平與安寧？任何不穩定因素都值得警惕！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（......就拉特蘭人這個天天大街放炮的德行嗎......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "銃騎吉奧瓦尼閣下，您該不會是好久沒動用您那把威風的大銃了，想找點事情活動活動吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我以我的銃為榮，有什麼問題嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......幾位閣下，事態緊急，或許容我繼續？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......請。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "諸位想必瞭解，我和莫斯提馬曾與安多恩......共事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就我瞭解，安多恩的風格是不做多餘之事，不開無準備之戰。因此，即使他有能力在拉特蘭製造混亂，也不會製造無目的之混亂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "目前，除了意圖控制名為塞茜莉亞的混血女孩，迷途者沒有留下針對其他方向的行動痕跡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "合理推測迷途者此行主要目的即為奪取塞茜莉亞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鑑於對方已經得手，我認為下一步他最有可能的行動應當是......離開拉特蘭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因此，我建議接下來的行動重視以下兩個方向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "首先，提高邊境管理等級，增派戍衛隊駐守出入關口，可組建特勤隊伍隱蔽搜索迷途者藏身處，緝捕安多恩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其次，保險起見，請第七廳牽頭調查迷途者是否與到訪使節或其他會議經辦人員接觸，評估迷途者以會議為目標的機率，提交對策案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至於會議本身......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "繼續按日程推，薇爾麗芙就想這樣吧。反正這一次不是試水嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦不過，冷餐會的甜點太難吃了，仙人掌塔是不是有點離譜？望改進。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我倒是覺得很有風味嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_361_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唯有這點，我與莫斯提馬意見一致。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "胡說！照我看口味非常不錯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_355_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然銃騎吉奧瓦尼閣下都發話了，我想我們可以達成一致。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_361_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "同意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "吉奧瓦尼喜歡的一定難吃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "莫斯提馬，你這是在藐視我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "............"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "孩子們，把聲音放低點，我老啦，經不起嚷嚷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "律令指引我們對前所未有之事報以善意......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們不應對水果塔如此苛刻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_361_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我怎麼不知道這條“律令”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我今天早上剛想的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": ".................."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "教宗閣下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就按你說的辦吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "薇爾，吉奧瓦尼，幫著點菲亞梅塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安多恩......自會行至他的終點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "26_g1_laterano_cathedralfront"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼，所以說我最討厭閉門會議......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正題三分鐘就談完了，其他時間都在胡扯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4036_forcer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兩位，閣下們的決定是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你還在這。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "緝捕安多恩的事我來接手。這幾天你也辛苦了，回家休息吧。我會和公證所那邊打招呼，之前的事就算你配合我這邊行動了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4036_forcer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "菲亞梅塔小姐，我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接下來的事已經超出你的職權和能力範圍。別忘了，你實訓期都沒過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道你擔心塞茜莉亞。但這件事由我接手，已經是你能指望的最好情況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4036_forcer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4036_forcer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "菲亞梅塔小姐，你和這位......墮天使小姐，是朋友嗎？你們和安多恩，是......舊識？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4036_forcer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是對兩個問題的回答嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是舊識，是舊仇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過你放心，我不會遷怒塞茜莉亞，雖然我不明白早上她為什麼......但她只是個小孩子而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倒是你，你在那個地方待了兩天，安多恩和你說什麼了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4036_forcer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......一些離經叛道的話而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我建議你全忘掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還有自己的生活，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "回去休幾天假，然後在公證所好好幹，我看你資質不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要珍惜哦，拉特蘭的生活是很珍貴的。連我這種人，有時候也會懷念一下呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4036_forcer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "自己的生活......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4036_forcer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......也對，和他們比起來，我明明只是個普通人啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4036_forcer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "下班了下班了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4036_forcer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "26_g8_laterano_dwelling"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕蒂亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_357_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "戍衛隊已經全面接管邊卡，教宗騎士也在盯著，暫時沒辦法走了......雖然準備了安全屋，可......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕蒂亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_357_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奧倫那邊也聯繫不上......該死！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係，我們可以等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞茜莉亞？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "後悔了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我不知道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，如果和菲亞梅塔姐姐走，就要去......大教堂了，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還沒有想明白......和媽媽道別的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係，塞茜莉亞，你可以慢慢想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......修士先生，剛才在安魂教堂，有一個又有角又有光環的姐姐，她......是薩科塔嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許是，也許不是。她自己決定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我以為......薩科塔就是薩科塔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對於大部分人來說，確實如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但有的人可以選擇，或者說不得不選擇，出於一些......不幸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很巧，塞茜莉亞，你也要選擇。至於這是你的不幸還是幸運......無人可知曉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "薩科塔不能和薩卡茲在一起嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然可以，你就是明證。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是我......是不是給大家添麻煩了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾澤爾哥哥也......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞茜莉亞，如果你這樣擔心，就什麼也做不了了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人們總會爭鬥。“溫柔”也好，“理解”也好，停止不了這一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很多時候人與人爭鬥，不是因為哪一方善，哪一方惡，而是因為彼此要做的事互相抵牾......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是說，你和我要做的事不一樣，我們常常會擋在別人的路上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼大家不能一起走呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為許多人的去路是由來路決定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "譬如薩科塔與薩卡茲。即使已經沒有人能說出最初爭鬥的緣由，數千年的仇恨也已經築成道路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "道路不是可以自己選嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可以，塞茜莉亞，但沒那麼容易。你想要離開原來的道路，尋找新的道路，就要走到無邊的荒原上......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "茫茫曠野，也許永遠無法找到，你卻付出了一生與一切，作為代價。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那，那為什麼還要找......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是啊，為什麼還要找呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許只是想要這麼做吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......“想要”......有這麼重要嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那是我們唯一擁有的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "修士先生......我可以問嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請問吧，塞茜莉亞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您想要的是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......塞茜莉亞，我可以和你講個故事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係的，修士先生，您請講吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很多年前，我還年輕的時候，我遇到了......挫折，然後我就離開了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去哪裡呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去任何地方，四處......旅行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在一個地方待了一陣子，一個很小的小鎮，和我的家鄉有點像。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是更破敗，更衰落，每個人都過得艱難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（咦？這聽上去一點都不像拉特蘭啊......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一次我路過鎮上的酒館，撞到一個哼著歌的酒鬼，他吐了我一身，還說是我絆倒了他，要我替他把酒錢付了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "酒館裡的每一個人，不對，鎮上的每一個人都笑話他、咒駡他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "膽子小的人躲著他走，大家說他是骯髒齷齪的混蛋、無賴、病癆鬼......那是一個薩卡茲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但沒有人真的把他趕出鎮子，他就這麼勉勉強強活著，做點零工度日。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有一天晚上，颳風，下很大的雨，沒有人願意出門。但是教堂的鐘聲響了，是示警的鐘聲，吵醒了每一個人......有，壞人來了鎮上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好在鐘聲吵醒了大家。雖然很艱難，最終還是把壞人趕走了。誰也不知道鐘是誰敲響的，大家都說這一定是神跡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我順著鐘樓方向找到外面的荒地，發現了正在掘墓的教堂看門人，旁邊的板車上是一口薄棺材，裡面躺著遍體鱗傷的薩卡茲酒鬼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我幫忙掘墓，看門人一邊挖一邊罵，抱怨留給自己老娘的棺材便宜了薩卡茲，又咒駡得病的薩卡茲得趕快埋了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看門人說，鐘響了沒多久，薩卡茲來拍他的門讓他趁亂快跑，然後就死在門口了，晦氣得不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看門人說，他只是看要下雨了，有點不忍心，讓薩卡茲在鐘樓湊合一晚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他一邊罵，一邊挖土。把人埋了之後，站在墳前，學著唱酒鬼總唱的那首歌，但又沒記住後面的調子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最後罵了兩句，倒了半瓶酒在墳頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "高高山上的風♪......隨英雄遠去♪......行過長路♪......踏過荊棘♪......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真抱歉，我也沒記住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是......那首歌，媽媽教給我的，羅塞菈姐姐教給我的歌......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......所以，是那個薩卡茲敲響了鐘？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那他也是救了大家的英雄了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許是吧。我不知道他這樣的人能不能被稱為英雄。很多人大概不會願意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說不定他也只是想讓幫了自己一把的看門人能跑掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那修士先生你呢，你覺得他是英雄嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......英雄又是什麼呢，塞茜莉亞？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我確實想了很久......但我知道，回答這個問題，決定的不是那個薩卡茲是什麼人，而是我是什麼人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "若說他自己，我想他不會是為了成為英雄登上鐘樓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無論我們讚美他，貶低他，抑或將他忘卻，都與他無關了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一切的輾轉反側，只與我自己有關......為什麼我會目睹這件事？它對我意味著什麼？它要給予我怎樣的啟示？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "被考問的總是活著的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我總在想，我總在想，如果他不做，會如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他做了，反而把狂信......壞人引來鐘樓會如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鎮上的人被叫醒了也抵擋不住會如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "甚至，要是他死在鐘樓上無人發現，然後......會如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有必成的做法，沒有必定正確的選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最後我想，在那個滂沱大雨的深夜，他登上鐘樓，只是因為他想那麼做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一個最直接的念頭，一點點拗不過去的善意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "成與不成，不是他的事情了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他是英雄。和那首歌裡的英雄沒什麼不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅塞菈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_363_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "高高山上的風♪......隨英雄遠去♪......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......行過長路♪......踏過荊棘♪......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "也有其他人跟著哼起了歌。\n低低的歌聲在房間流淌。\n我感到安寧。\n在拉特蘭的夜裡。\n暌違已久的安寧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......在想什麼，修士先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不，什麼也沒想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝你，塞茜莉亞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您在看......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是鐘樓嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是拉特蘭的鐘樓，很老很老的石塔，我還在拉特蘭的時候，有時去那裡看看，離天空很近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天上......媽媽現在就在那裡嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_351_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......如果你希望的話，她就在那裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_352_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......修士先生，能幫我一個忙嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
